WEBVTT

00:00:11.109 --> 00:00:12.189
(GROANS)

00:00:13.549 --> 00:00:14.669
(GRUNTS)

00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:16.789
(BEEPING)

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:18.109
(PANTING)

00:00:18.189 --> 00:00:19.189
(GRUNTS)

00:00:26.469 --> 00:00:28.109
(ALARM RINGING)

00:00:28.189 --> 00:00:29.389
-(GRUNTS)
-Sorry!

00:00:37.469 --> 00:00:38.549
(ELASTIGIRL GROANS)

00:00:52.549 --> 00:00:53.549
(BEEPS)

00:00:53.629 --> 00:00:54.869
(EXPLOSION)

00:00:58.869 --> 00:01:00.789
(GRUNTING)

00:01:01.749 --> 00:01:02.949
(STAMMERS) What happened?

00:01:03.109 --> 00:01:05.789
What happened is
you destroyed my evidence.

00:01:06.309 --> 00:01:07.789
What's going on?
What did I do?

00:01:07.949 --> 00:01:09.509
What did you guys do to me?

00:01:09.709 --> 00:01:12.109
That's right, punk.
Blame the system.

00:01:13.309 --> 00:01:14.989
Your tracker worked
like a charm, Evelyn.

00:01:15.149 --> 00:01:16.149
You're a genius.

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:17.429
Aw, shucks!

00:01:17.589 --> 00:01:20.029
I'm just the genius
behind the genius.

00:01:20.109 --> 00:01:22.549
-(TV PLAYING)
-DASH: Hey, Dad.

00:01:22.709 --> 00:01:26.309
We're doing fractions
and denismals and percentages

00:01:26.469 --> 00:01:27.469
and I don't get 'em.

00:01:27.549 --> 00:01:28.669
Aren't you...

00:01:28.749 --> 00:01:29.989
Didn't we get all caught up?

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:31.509
Yeah, we were caught up...

00:01:31.669 --> 00:01:34.869
and now we're doing fractions
and percentages and demicels.

00:01:35.029 --> 00:01:35.989
Decimals.

00:01:36.149 --> 00:01:37.189
NEWS ANCHOR: (ON TV) ...the
addition of the Incredibile,

00:01:37.269 --> 00:01:38.269
the super car...

00:01:38.429 --> 00:01:41.549
once driven by superhero,
Mr. Incredible.

00:01:41.749 --> 00:01:44.509
It's the kind of thing you buy
when you have everything else.

00:01:44.709 --> 00:01:47.029
They said it was
beyond repair.

00:01:47.189 --> 00:01:48.269
VICTOR CATCHET: Hey,
it was in perfect condition.

00:01:48.429 --> 00:01:49.989
You used to drive that?

00:01:50.149 --> 00:01:51.789
They said it was destroyed.

00:01:51.949 --> 00:01:53.669
Long thought lost
or destroyed,

00:01:53.749 --> 00:01:55.589
the famous car
turned up at private auction.

00:01:55.749 --> 00:01:57.029
They said it was...

00:01:57.189 --> 00:01:58.629
That's my car!

00:01:59.189 --> 00:02:00.829
-(TV CONTINUES PLAYING)
-(GRUNTS)

00:02:01.789 --> 00:02:03.389
(COUGHING)

00:02:07.109 --> 00:02:09.629
Stupid water feature!

00:02:09.789 --> 00:02:12.349
This car is just loaded
with amazing gadgets.

00:02:12.429 --> 00:02:13.429
Care to demonstrate?

00:02:13.589 --> 00:02:15.629
I'd love to,
but we haven't figured out

00:02:15.709 --> 00:02:16.869
how to make them work yet.

00:02:17.469 --> 00:02:18.709
(BOTH GASP)

00:02:19.189 --> 00:02:22.149
-Wow! It works?
-(PEOPLE ON TV SCREAMING)

00:02:23.469 --> 00:02:24.509
Huh?

00:02:25.029 --> 00:02:27.229
What are you doing?
This is not a toy!

00:02:27.309 --> 00:02:28.469
That's a rocket launcher!

00:02:28.669 --> 00:02:30.549
Sweet! Which one launches
the rocket?

00:02:30.709 --> 00:02:32.149
Hey!
This is not your car!

00:02:32.309 --> 00:02:33.669
It's not your car, either!

00:02:33.829 --> 00:02:35.309
It is so!
It's the Incredibile.

00:02:35.509 --> 00:02:37.429
-Why's that guy have it?
-He shouldn't!

00:02:37.589 --> 00:02:39.109
Launch the rockets!
Launch the rockets!

00:02:39.189 --> 00:02:40.229
Launch the rockets!

00:02:40.429 --> 00:02:41.949
-I'm not launching anything!
-I wanna blow it up!

00:02:42.029 --> 00:02:43.149
Do you think I want
an angry rich guy...

00:02:43.349 --> 00:02:44.909
coming after me right now...

00:02:45.069 --> 00:02:46.549
-when I'm trying not to...
-WOMAN: (ON TV) I'm not sure

00:02:46.629 --> 00:02:47.709
-what's happened here, Mark.
-...distract your mother.

00:02:47.789 --> 00:02:49.229
But everyone here
has scattered

00:02:49.309 --> 00:02:51.109
and I'm afraid I'll need
to move at any minute.

00:02:51.189 --> 00:02:53.749
(GROANS) Rich guy got my car.

00:02:55.789 --> 00:02:58.349
So, you're not gonna
steal your car

00:02:58.429 --> 00:02:59.829
back from the rich guy?

00:03:01.429 --> 00:03:02.789
-(SNEEZES)
-(BOB GASPS)

00:03:03.389 --> 00:03:05.069
(OBJECTS CLATTERING)

00:03:05.149 --> 00:03:07.149
(VIOLET SCREAMING)

00:03:08.629 --> 00:03:10.349
What the heck is that?

00:03:10.429 --> 00:03:12.309
(GROWLING)

00:03:12.389 --> 00:03:14.189
-(LAUGHING)
-(SIGHS)

00:03:14.269 --> 00:03:16.189
Jack-Jack has powers?

00:03:16.349 --> 00:03:17.349
Well, yeah, but...

00:03:17.549 --> 00:03:18.909
-You knew about this?
-Yeah.

00:03:19.069 --> 00:03:20.669
-Why didn't you tell us?
-I don't know.

00:03:20.829 --> 00:03:23.069
We're your kids.
We need to know these things.

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:24.469
-Did you tell Mom?
-No.

00:03:24.629 --> 00:03:26.389
-Why not?
-Your mother is not...

00:03:26.549 --> 00:03:27.549
You'd want us to tell you,
wouldn't you?

00:03:27.629 --> 00:03:29.629
-Why would you not tell Mom?
-Because I didn't wanna...

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:30.589
What?

00:03:30.669 --> 00:03:31.949
-Come on, man.
-Because it's not the time.

00:03:32.069 --> 00:03:33.029
-Why?
-Because...

00:03:33.189 --> 00:03:34.229
So uncool!

00:03:34.309 --> 00:03:35.589
Because I'm formulating, okay?

00:03:36.509 --> 00:03:39.229
I'm taking in information,
I'm processing!

00:03:39.389 --> 00:03:41.309
I'm doing the math,
I'm fixing the boyfriend...

00:03:41.469 --> 00:03:42.469
and keeping the baby

00:03:42.549 --> 00:03:43.829
from turning into
a flaming monster!

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:45.069
How do I do it?

00:03:46.269 --> 00:03:48.349
By rolling with
the punches, baby!

00:03:48.509 --> 00:03:50.949
I eat thunder
and crap lightning, okay?

00:03:51.109 --> 00:03:52.829
'Cause I'm Mr. Incredible!

00:03:52.989 --> 00:03:56.109
Not Mr. So-So
or Mr. Mediocre-Guy.

00:03:56.269 --> 00:03:58.829
Mr. Incredible!

00:03:58.909 --> 00:03:59.949
(JACK-JACK CHUCKLES)

00:04:00.589 --> 00:04:02.109
We should call Lucius.

00:04:02.709 --> 00:04:04.309
No. I can handle it.

00:04:04.469 --> 00:04:06.309
-There's no way I'm gonna...
-(SNEEZES)

00:04:06.709 --> 00:04:07.869
(BOB GASPS)

00:04:08.389 --> 00:04:10.349
(YELLING)

00:04:10.429 --> 00:04:12.069
(JACK-JACK SCREAMING)

00:04:15.829 --> 00:04:17.469
Dada.

00:04:18.389 --> 00:04:20.149
I'm calling Lucius.

00:04:20.589 --> 00:04:22.469
-(TV PLAYING)
-(LAUGHING)

00:04:24.029 --> 00:04:26.469
Looks normal to me.
When did this start happening?

00:04:26.629 --> 00:04:28.509
Since Helen got the job.

00:04:28.709 --> 00:04:30.389
-I assume she knows?
-Are you kidding?

00:04:30.549 --> 00:04:31.989
I can't tell her about this,

00:04:32.069 --> 00:04:33.149
not while she's doing
hero work!

00:04:33.309 --> 00:04:34.309
Mama!

00:04:34.389 --> 00:04:35.389
ELASTIGIRL: (ON TV)
Girls, come on.

00:04:35.469 --> 00:04:36.749
Leave the saving the world
to the men?

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:38.149
-I don't think so.
-Mama!

00:04:38.949 --> 00:04:40.589
I've got to succeed!

00:04:40.749 --> 00:04:42.389
So she can succeed.

00:04:42.549 --> 00:04:45.109
-So we can succeed!
-I get it, Bob!

00:04:45.269 --> 00:04:47.789
I get it. When was
the last time you slept?

00:04:47.949 --> 00:04:49.549
Who keeps track of that?

00:04:49.709 --> 00:04:51.189
Besides, he's a baby.

00:04:51.309 --> 00:04:53.469
I can handle it,
I got this handled.

00:04:53.629 --> 00:04:55.589
So, you good then?

00:04:55.749 --> 00:04:58.069
You got everything
under control? Right?

00:04:58.149 --> 00:04:59.549
(JACK-JACK GURGLING)

00:05:00.869 --> 00:05:01.909
What the...?

00:05:01.989 --> 00:05:03.189
(JACK-JACK BABBLING
FROM OTHER DIMENSION)

00:05:03.269 --> 00:05:05.349
Cookie! Cha Cha want a cookie?

00:05:05.509 --> 00:05:08.229
Num-num cookie?
Cha Cha wanna num-num?

00:05:08.389 --> 00:05:11.029
Num-num cookie! Cookie!

00:05:11.189 --> 00:05:12.269
-You're not...
-Cookie!

00:05:12.429 --> 00:05:13.789
-Oh, my God!
-Cookie!

00:05:13.949 --> 00:05:15.509
-Dada! Dada. Dada.
-LUCIUS: Whoa.

00:05:15.709 --> 00:05:17.429
Okay! Okay.

00:05:17.629 --> 00:05:19.389
So, he can still
hear you from the...

00:05:19.589 --> 00:05:21.429
From the other dimension,
yeah.

00:05:21.629 --> 00:05:23.629
That is freaky.
I mean, that's not like...

00:05:23.789 --> 00:05:26.669
Not like our other kids.
No, it is not.

00:05:26.829 --> 00:05:29.269
-Full powers, totally random.
-(GURGLING)

00:05:29.389 --> 00:05:31.709
So now, he's what? Is he good?

00:05:31.869 --> 00:05:33.909
Yeah, you'd think so, right?

00:05:34.069 --> 00:05:36.629
Obviously, I can't keep
giving him cookies!

00:05:36.989 --> 00:05:38.869
-Uh-uh?
-But if I stop...

00:05:38.949 --> 00:05:40.189
(GROWLING)

00:05:42.549 --> 00:05:44.389
Ahhh! He is freaking!
Again, he is freaking!

00:05:44.549 --> 00:05:45.949
No biting the daddy!

00:05:46.109 --> 00:05:47.109
-What the...?
-No biting!

00:05:52.989 --> 00:05:55.109
-(CRYING)
-Okay.

00:05:56.989 --> 00:05:59.709
I think I just need
a little bit of me time.

00:05:59.869 --> 00:06:01.229
Then I'll be good to go.

00:06:01.389 --> 00:06:03.509
Oh, you need
more than me time, Bob.

00:06:03.669 --> 00:06:05.429
You need
major life realignment

00:06:05.509 --> 00:06:06.669
on a number of levels.

00:06:06.829 --> 00:06:09.349
Starting with
baby superfreak here!

00:06:09.509 --> 00:06:13.069
You need some solid
outside-the-box thinking.

00:06:21.909 --> 00:06:23.349
Galbaki?

00:06:23.509 --> 00:06:27.469
Elastigirl's supersuit
is by Galbaki?

00:06:27.629 --> 00:06:29.029
Explain yourself!

00:06:29.109 --> 00:06:30.949
(JACK-JACK CRYING)

00:06:32.429 --> 00:06:34.909
Oh, my God.
You're worse than I thought.

00:06:35.069 --> 00:06:37.909
It's the baby.
I brought the baby.

00:06:37.989 --> 00:06:39.029
(JACK-JACK SQUEALS)

00:06:39.509 --> 00:06:41.749
Oh, highly unusual.

